# Pairs with RAllOrNothing. A detached shipper rewinds and leaves the log when the
# peer echoes an export epoch past its marker. The WAL GC no longer holds the log
# for a detached consumer, so a later trim can pass a prepare the shipper has not
# read while its terminal ships. MaybeClearReseedAsync never rewinds while
# detached (#4691's detector).
MODULE: RAllOrNothingRewindWhileDetached
TARGET: RAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a detached shipper rewinds on the peer's echo of a later export epoch
PERTURBS: ReseedRewind
BOUNDS: LossPath = 2, JoinStart = 0, SagaOutcome = 0, Shape = 0

--- FIND
    /\ rs = "drained"
    /\ ~detached
    /\ ~preguard

--- REPLACE
    /\ rs = "drained"
\* MUTATION: the rewind ignores the detach.
    /\ ~preguard

--- END
